   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,413:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Un activo financiero
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,415:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (de los 10 disponibles: Gold, Silver, Nvidia, Apple, Google, Inditex, Bitcoin,
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,416:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ethereum, TetherUSDT, S
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,416:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,417:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: P 500 Vanguard).
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,418:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,418:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Una familia de features
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,419:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (un subconjunto concreto de variables que el agente puede 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,419:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,420:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ver
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,420:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,421:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  para
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,422:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: tomar decisiones).
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,422:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Por ejemplo, el escenario 1 es: 
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,423:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,424:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Entrenar un agente usando solo las medias móviles simples (SMA) sobre datos de
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,424:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Oro
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,425:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,429:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: . El escenario 14 es el mismo pero con datos de Plata. El escenario 131 es entrenar con el grupo combinado de
   DEBUG: 2026-05-01 23:34:53,430:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tendencia (SMA + EMA + MACD) sobre Oro. Y así sucesivamente.
